@segment  campfire
@title    Astral Campfire — Arrival
@levels   F15
@shelved  source session removed by user on 2026-08-22
@duration ~3m

say You find yourself in the quiet void of the starfield of reality.
pause 6
say In this exercise, you will light a campfire. An invitation to any individuals equal to or greater than yourself, who may wish to join you.
pause 6
say The fireplace is prepared before you, the wood neatly stacked and waiting.
pause 5
say Kneel down and see the small box of matches lying there for you. Slide it open. Take a match. And light it.
pause 6
say Hear the sharp scratch, see the flare of light.
pause 4
say Guide the flame into the waiting timber. Lean close, blow gently, and watch as the small spark grows into a steady fire.
pause 8
say The campfire is now lit. A beacon of presence and connection.
pause 6
say Feel the warmth of the flames brushing against your skin.
pause 5
say Hear the gentle crackle and pop as the wood begins to burn.
pause 5
say Notice the faint smell of smoke curling into the night air.
pause 5
say Watch how the firelight flickers and bends, casting soft shadows that move across the ground.
pause 8
say When you feel the fire burning steadily, take your place nearby. Sit comfortably, and let its glow settle you here and now.
pause 10
say The beacon is lit. You are present. Now let others approach in their own time.
pause 10
